  "query": "how do I start a return with a prepaid label",
  "results": [
   {
    "chunk_id": "c1",
    "input_id": "KI-00001",
    "input_title": "Returns Policy 2026.pdf",
    "score": 0.86,
    "metadata": {
     "page": 2
    },
    "text": "We want you to be confident that the gear you buy will work for your adventures, so the return process is designed to be simple and fair. How to start a return: 1. Sign in to your account and open Order History, then choose \"Start a Return\". 2. Select the items and choose a reason. A prepaid return label will be emailed within 1 business day."
   },
   {
    "chunk_id": "c2",
    "input_id": "KI-00005",
    "input_title": "Warranty Terms.pdf",
    "score": 0.71,
    "metadata": {
     "page": 2
    },
    "text": "Gather your order number or receipt. If you bought in store, the receipt scan in your account is enough. A warranty specialist replies within 2 business days and issues a prepaid return label if inspection is needed. Inspection takes up to 5 business days after arrival at our service centre."
   },
   {
    "chunk_id": "c3",
    "input_id": "KI-00001",
    "input_title": "Returns Policy 2026.pdf",
    "score": 0.66,
    "metadata": {
     "page": 2,
     "page_end": 3
    },
    "text": "Pack the items in the original box or a sturdy bag and drop the parcel at any carrier location. Return shipping fees: returns for exchange or because of a defect are free. For all other returns a flat $6.95 return label fee is deducted from your refund. Trail Club members return everything for free."
   },
   {
    "chunk_id": "c4",
    "input_id": "KI-00014",
    "input_title": "Order Tracking Guide.md",
    "score": 0.52,
    "metadata": {
     "chunk_index": 1
    },
    "text": "When will I get a tracking number? You receive an order confirmation email immediately after purchase. A second email with a tracking number is sent when your order ships, usually within 1 business day for in-stock items. How to track: sign in and open Order History to see live status."
   }
